==Strategy==
This stage can easily be rushed with the help of [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jellycat]], [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]], with [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to block the base's [[Wave Attack|wave attacks]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to rush the base down. An example of this strategy is provided in the video below.

